{"3989100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Junk Rise", "steam_appid": 3989100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/8f1d7bdf61e74779a64a5d953f0d6a1d.avif?t=1782591487\" width=1386 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your recycling empire from junk! Collect, process, and craft valuable products in a chill, satisfying simulator where garbage becomes gold ♻️ .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.poster.avif?t=1782591487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.webm?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/1f74d3d62bb1fb3d6217fe84023c2e1b.mp4?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JunkRise is a creative recycling simulator where trash isn't just waste – it's opportunity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a colorful world full of abandoned scraps, busted electronics, and forgotten treasures. It's your job to gather them, sort them, and turn them into something useful... or profitable 💰.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛠️ Build your own recycling factory from scratch – place machines, connect conveyor belts, and automate your entire workflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚚 Drive around, collect junk, discover hidden areas, and expand your operation one upgrade at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 As your factory grows, so does your impact. Clean the world, one crushed can at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Collect plastic, metal, electronics, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Build and expand your factory with modular machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Automate item sorting and processing with conveyors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Craft new products and sell them for profit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Explore and unlock new areas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Relaxing, stylized visuals with satisfying mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔹 Zero waste. Just good vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 From junkyard to city life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey doesn't stop at recycling — expand your empire, buy your own house, and unlock access to your dream factory in the bustling streets of JunkRise. 💰🌇</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.poster.avif?t=1782591487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.webm?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/9d3d67e80fe55e721a8ada8135f33e35.mp4?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗💨 Cruise through your junkyard empire in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn trash into treasure as you drive your custom-built vehicle across vibrant landscapes. Whether you're hauling scrap or delivering crafted goods — the road is yours! 🌍🔧</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/dc6656aeb4499bedde70071360713008.poster.avif?t=1782591487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/dc6656aeb4499bedde70071360713008.webm?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/dc6656aeb4499bedde70071360713008.mp4?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔋 Power up your progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your batteries and keep your factory running at full force. Energy is the heart of your recycling empire — no power, no production! ⚡🏭</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/3613dce12612b569246d46b1d7eaf9f1.poster.avif?t=1782591487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/3613dce12612b569246d46b1d7eaf9f1.webm?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/3613dce12612b569246d46b1d7eaf9f1.mp4?t=1782591487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3989100/extras/8f1d7bdf61e74779a64a5d953f0d6a1d.avif?t=1782591487\" width=1386 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your recycling empire from junk! Collect, process, and craft valuable products in a chill, satisfying simulator where garbage be